Z||000027||SLYGUY||09-29-2001||02:33 PM||||I've always like the manual shift the best. My first car was a 5 spd (84 GTI). <P>LZeitgeist<P>---------------------------------------------"To me, an automatic in a Fiero negates a great deal of why a Fiero feels right to me. <BR>Just my personal preference... "<P>I agree. <BR>My parent had an 87 GT with an auto. <BR>More of a tourer than something you have fun with.<BR>You don't feel like you are driving the car with an automatic.<BR>You feel like a passenger, even in the driver's seat.<P>I feel totally connected to my GT with the manual. Wish it had the 4spd though. Loved the second gear in my 86 SEV6.<BR>Was that an option?<BR>LOL<P>Sly<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SLYGUYSIG.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000028||Dumba$$||09-29-2001||02:44 PM||||call me a sissy, but auto all the way,<BR>the shift kit made a huge differance<P>when i  had my 93 mustang 5.0  nobody liked the fact that it was an auto <BR>but the same people also didnt like the fact that i beat them all of the time!!!<P>just remember clutch boyz ,<BR>when you let off the gas to shift were still accelerating!!!<BR>butt on the other hand my jetta vr6<BR>was a hell of alot of fun!!<P>auto = no clutch to replace  <BR>(and no nuckels to bust or tools to throw when your pissed  cuz you cant get a bolt out<BR>)<P>------------------<BR>Rich<BR>Sioux Falls SD<BR>Red 84 SE<BR>Gold 86 SE <BR>98 acura cl 3.0<P>4.9 caddy engine for sale 30,000 miles complete with bubba joes mounts!!  $850<P>if it dont go, put a fart can, and clear taillights on it!!||||reg||1
Z||000029||Dumba$$||09-29-2001||02:52 PM||||oh yea, the jetta was a 5 spd.<P>another reason  my vote is for auto is,<BR>every fiero clutch ive driven, the clutch is  stiff or hard to hold down,<BR>and my problem with that is i have flat feet<BR>and i cant hold pressure with my feet or they cramp up terribly in the arch that i dont have!!<BR>so ya im a puss,<P>------------------<BR>Rich<BR>Sioux Falls SD<BR>Red 84 SE<BR>Gold 86 SE <BR>98 acura cl 3.0<P>4.9 caddy engine for sale 30,000 miles complete with bubba joes mounts!!  $850<P>if it dont go, put a fart can, and clear taillights on it!!||||reg||1
